  "name": "bibi",
  "description": "Video summarizer agent skill for Claude Code, Codex, ChatGPT, Cursor and OpenClaw. Summarize YouTube, Bilibili, TikTok, Twitter/X, Xiaohongshu (video and image notes), podcasts and any online or local video / audio; extract timestamped transcripts and subtitles; chapter-by-chapter summaries; optionally remix the takeaway into a TikTok-style vertical music video. Not for already-saved videos (`bibi-library`), channel feeds (`bibi-feed`), or slides / frames / mind maps (`bibi-vision`): sibling skills, same CLI and account. Triggers: \"summarize this video\", \"what's this video about\", \"get transcript\", \"extract subtitles\", \"YouTube summary\", \"podcast notes\", \"video to notes\", \"video summarizer\", \"总结这个视频\", \"帮我看看这个视频讲了什么\", \"B站总结\", \"video to TikTok MV\", \"把视频变成 TikTok\". Works via the bibi CLI (macOS/Windows), the hosted MCP server, or OpenAPI (Linux / no CLI).",
